+`GET /admin/events` can also be narrowed by `type`, `provider` and a `from` /
+`to` range on the time we received the event, for example
+`/admin/events?provider=acme&type=refund.created&from=2026-01-01`. Results come
+a page at a time: pass the `nextCursor` of one page as `cursor` to get the
+next. `orderBy` takes a column and direction and defaults to
+`received_at DESC`.
